  "mainEntity": {
    "name": "Should a Garage Conversion Become an ADU or Extra Room?",
    "text": "Should a Garage Conversion Become an ADU or Extra Room?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "Whether a converted garage becomes a room addition or an ADU depends mainly on how it will function, how it connects to the home, and the applicable local requirements. In the City of San Diego, creating an ADU requires a building permit, and a garage conversion may involve additional design and approval considerations, particularly in coastal areas.",
